## Self-Check for Test Files

Before finishing, verify:
- [ ] Integration tests 使用 `WebApplicationFactory<Startup>`？
- [ ] `IService` 透過 `ConfigureServices` 中 `AddSingleton` 覆蓋注入？
- [ ] 無 `new HttpClient()` 指向部署 URL？
- [ ] 無 `[Fact(Skip = ...)]`？
- [ ] Unit tests 直接 new Service，mock `IProvider`？
- [ ] 覆蓋：Happy Path + Edge Case + Error Path 三類？
